  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Food Bank to feed poor people in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Approximately 25 million Nigerians are currently suffering from severe hunger. The nation&apos;s already imploding economy was exacerbated by COVID-19, leaving millions of homes without food and other basic needs. The Ogadagidi Global Empowerment Initiative has launched a food bank in the Edem-Ani community to provide food and other assistance to very poor people and families. By tackling food insecurity, we hope to provide greater access to health, education, and a more productive future.</narrative>
  </description>
